+//   * capability staff.manage behind StaffWebAuthGuard, default deny (grants only);
+//   * self-deactivation (actor.staffId === target id) refused with 403 before any write;
+//   * strong If-Match '"staff-v<N>"' (the ETag format of GET /staff/{id} and the
